@startuml kairos-activate-deactivate-member-sequence
title Deactivate or Reactivate Member

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click "Deactivate" on Member
WebAdmin -> Admin: Show confirmation modal
Admin -> WebAdmin: Confirm
WebAdmin -> API: PATCH /members/{id}/status {active:false}
API -> DB: UPDATE Member SET active=false
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK
WebAdmin --> Admin: Update UI (status=Inactive)

' Reactivate is symmetric
@enduml
